  driver4@udart.co.tz        Driver           password
  driver5@udart.co.tz        Driver           password

  The seeder also creates 10 buses (UDART-001 to UDART-010), sample
  work orders, maintenance records, PM schedules, spare parts, sensor
  readings, and AI prediction records.

===============================================
12. SCHEDULED COMMANDS
===============================================

  These commands run automatically via Laravel Task Scheduler.
  They can also be run manually at any time.

  Command                                    Schedule  What It Does
  -----------------------------------------  --------  ----------------------------------
  maintenance:generate-schedules             Daily     Creates PM entries for all buses
                                                       and advances completed schedules
  maintenance:check-due                      Daily     Marks overdue PM; sends 7-day and
                                                       3-day advance notifications
  maintenance:enforce-restrictions           Daily     Locks buses with overdue PM;
                                                       unlocks fully compliant buses
  predictions:run-all                        Weekly    Runs AI prediction for every
                                                       active bus and saves results

  Run manually:
  php artisan maintenance:generate-schedules
  php artisan maintenance:check-due
  php artisan maintenance:enforce-restrictions
  php artisan predictions:run-all

===============================================
13. DEPLOYMENT
===============================================

PRODUCTION SERVER REQUIREMENTS
-------------------------------
  - PHP 8.2+ with extensions: mbstring, openssl, PDO, tokenizer,
    XML, ctype, JSON, BCMath
  - MySQL 8.0+
  - Nginx or Apache with SSL (HTTPS required for ESP32 IoT push)
  - Supervisor for queue workers

DEPLOYMENT STEPS
----------------

  1. Server Preparation
     sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y
     sudo apt install php8.2 php8.2-fpm nginx mysql-server

  2. Application Deployment
     git clone <repository-url> udart
     cd udart
     composer install --optimize-autoloader --no-dev
     npm install && npm run build

  3. Environment & Keys
     cp .env.example .env
     php artisan key:generate
     (Edit .env with production database, mail, ESP32, and Flask values)

  4. Database
     php artisan migrate --force
     php artisan db:seed --class=RoleSeeder
     php artisan db:seed --class=PermissionSeeder
     php artisan db:seed --class=BusSeeder

  5. Caching & Optimisation
     php artisan config:cache
     php artisan route:cache
     php artisan view:cache
     php artisan optimize

  6. Queue Workers (Supervisor)
     Create /etc/supervisor/conf.d/udart-worker.conf:

     [program:udart-worker]
     command=php /var/www/udart/artisan queue:work --sleep=3 --tries=3
     autostart=true
     autorestart=true
     user=www-data

     sudo supervisorctl reread
     sudo supervisorctl update
     sudo supervisorctl start udart-worker:*

  7. Task Scheduler (Cron)
     Add to crontab (crontab -e):
     * * * * * cd /var/www/udart && php artisan schedule:run >> /dev/null 2>&1

  8. SSL Certificate
     sudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx
     sudo certbot --nginx -d your-domain.com

